.SH "NAME"
pcre2_set_recursion_limit \- obsolete function; use pcre2_set_depth_limit
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.sp
.ss \n[.ss]
.nf
.fam C
\fB\&#include\fP \fB<pcre2.h>\fP

\fBint\fP pcre2_set_recursion_limit(\fBpcre2_match_context\fP *\fImcontext\fP,
                              \fBuint32_t\fP \fIlimit\fP);
.fam
.fi
.ss \n[.ss] 0
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.sp
This function is obsolete and should not be used in new code. Use
pcre2_set_depth_limit() instead.
.sp
There is a complete description of the PCRE2 native API in the
\f(CRpcre2api\fP
page and a description of the POSIX API in the
\f(CRpcre2posix\fP
page.